\pard\b\fs20 Outpost\b0\par
\fs16\par
This old outpost was abandoned after pirates overran it. But now a few assassins, each on their own, have set out to salvage the last usable items from the ruins. None of them wants to share with the others, though, so they decided to leave everything to whoever is still alive at the end of the night...\par
